<div id="kitg"></div>
</section>

<section id="proc" aria-label="Process"><div class="bgt" data-s="-.15">PROCESS</div>
<div class="eyebrow rv">(06) How I work</div>
<h2 class="big rv" style="margin-top:22px">From messy rows to <em>clear answers.</em></h2>
<div class="steps">
<div class="st rv"><i>01</i><h3>Collect</h3><p>Pull the right tables with joins, CTEs and window functions.</p><div class="tl"><span>MySQL</span><span>Excel 365</span></div></div>
<div class="st rv"><i>02</i><h3>Clean</h3><p>Fix types, duplicates and gaps so every number can be trusted.</p><div class="tl"><span>Power Query</span><span>XLOOKUP</span></div></div>
<div class="st rv"><i>03</i><h3>Model</h3><p>Build star schemas and DAX measures for KPIs and time intelligence.</p><div class="tl"><span>Star schema</span><span>DAX</span><span>Power Pivot</span></div></div>
<div class="st rv"><i>04</i><h3>Tell</h3><p>Turn the model into dashboards with a clear takeaway on page one.</p><div class="tl"><span>Power BI</span><span>Pivot tables</span><span>KPI reporting</span></div></div>
</div>
</section>

