<div class="tlr rv"><small>2018 to 2021</small><div><h3>B.Com, Barrackpore Rastraguru Surendranath College</h3><p>Commerce, West Bengal State University, Kolkata. A commerce background that makes sales, margin and order data feel familiar.</p></div></div>
<div class="tlr rv"><small>May 2026</small><div><h3>Webskitters Academy</h3><p>Data Analytics training in SQL, Power BI and Excel 365, with eight hands-on projects.</p></div></div>
<div class="tlr rv"><small>Sep to Oct 2026</small><div><h3>Best Performer Award</h3><p>Recognised by Webskitters Academy for performance in the Data Analytics program.</p></div></div>
</section>

<section id="contact" aria-label="Contact">
